steps.prompt:
You are a threat intelligence analyst. Extract all IOCs from the following input. Return structured JSON with fields: type (ip/domain/hash/filepath/registry/mutex/useragent/url), value, confidence (high/medium/low), context.

Input:
{{input}}

You are a detection engineer. Using these IOCs:
{{iocs}}

And this MITRE ATT&CK mapping:
{{mitre_mapping}}

Generate a complete, production-ready Sigma rule in YAML. Include: title, id (uuid), status (experimental), description, references, author, date, modified, tags (attack.tXXXX), logsource (product/category/service), detection (selection + condition), falsepositives, level (low/medium/high/critical).
